WEBVTT

00:09:29.583 --> 00:09:31.851
a perfectly legal,

00:09:31.875 --> 00:09:34.434
perfectly constitutional coup

00:09:34.458 --> 00:09:38.934
against the very idea
of majority rule in the United States.

00:09:38.958 --> 00:09:41.726
That is possible under our constitution,

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:43.309
and it can happen this year.

00:09:43.333 --> 00:09:44.809
So what can you do about it?

00:09:44.833 --> 00:09:46.101
OK now, keep in mind,

00:09:46.125 --> 00:09:48.393
if the margin of the victory
is so massive,

00:09:48.417 --> 00:09:50.059
it's truly massive,

00:09:50.083 --> 00:09:53.434
the losing candidate's political party
is going to walk away

00:09:53.458 --> 00:09:55.351
and just let their leader go down.

00:09:55.375 --> 00:09:57.809
Nobody is going to risk
a constitutional crisis

00:09:57.833 --> 00:10:01.476
to save somebody who is super unpopular.